The information rent, with no shock at all: measurement noise $\sigma=0.03$ and AR(1) demand noise, reporting lag 0, twenty seeds. Institutions are indistinguishable by the shortage they record (1.56--1.64 per cent for five of six) and clearly distinguishable by the output they waste. Generated by scripts/paper_tables.py from results/B1b. Source: reference_results/ (the Lead's independent reference run; cross-checked against the experiment layer in reference_results/CROSSCHECK.md).
